 H('Final review sequence'),P('First reconcile source against the requirements and close or openly document mandatory blockers. Next rerun the appropriate checks for any changed code, update diagrams and replace historical-only assertions with exact new evidence where supported. Then fill team data, rehearse the recording and verify the final PDF and source link. Do not delete an existing database or rewrite migrations for a cleaner-looking demonstration.'),
